# Example only — see docs/CONFIG.md
name: metal-mirage-flux
runtime: go
description: Flux controllers via Helm (flux2 chart)
# Prefer: ./scripts/up.sh primary   (wires kubeconfig + install-flux.sh)
# Or:     ./scripts/up.sh flux [primary|standby]
# Manual:
#   pulumi config set --secret flux:kubeconfig "$(cat ../../.secrets/primary.kubeconfig)"
#   pulumi config set flux:repoUrl https://github.com/dakaii/metal-mirage
#   pulumi config set flux:branch main
#   pulumi config set flux:clusterPath ./gitops/clusters/primary
#   pulumi up --yes && ./scripts/install-flux.sh primary
